# LENS needs no secrets of its own — nothing here is required to run the demo.
#
# Kane CLI authentication lives in your Kane profile, not in this repo:
#     kane-cli login --username <user> --access-key <key>
#     kane-cli whoami
#
# The two things LENS does configure are committed, because they are part of the contract:
#     .lens/config.json                 appUrl, protected observables, attempt cap, budgets
#     .testmuai/variables/local.json    {{app_url}} as the browser contracts see it
#
# Point both at a different host if you are not serving Seatline on :3000.
